-> [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Install OpenWrt (generic explanation)]]

GL-XE300(Puli) ships with a web based bootloader firmware installer. 

From a powered off state: 
  - Press in the reset button
  - Apply power
  - Wait until the LAN LED flashes 5 times followed by a Solid Wifi LED
  - Release the reset button

The default IP for the bootloader is 192.168.1.1. You will need to manually set your devices IP to 192.168.1.2 or greater. 

Once you've reached the UBoot Web UI you will just click upload firmware, select the openwrt factory firmware file, and click the Update firmware button.

[[https://docs.gl-inet.com/router/en/3/tutorials/debrick/|Reference from OEM]]

